      <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo-text-processing">NeMo Text Processing</a> by NVIDIA, through FluidAudio</td><td>Turning spoken numbers, dates, and amounts into digits</td><td>Apache 2.0</td></tr>
